solid #7cd944;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .note-pink {\n    text-decoration: underline wavy #d94b8c;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 40px;\n    top: 460px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #c9a3c9;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .heart {\n    color: #d94b8c;\n  }\n  .bottom-note {\n    color: #b03fbf;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    border-bottom: 4px solid #b03fbf;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .bottom-note-wrap {\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-box\">\n    <h1>中考英语万能作文模板</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：阐述主题题型</h2>\n  <p class=\"req\">要求从一句话或一个主题出发，按照提纲的要求进行论述。</p>\n  <ol class=\"numbered\">\n    <li>阐述名言或主题所蕴含的意义。</li>\n    <li>分析并举例使其更充实。</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"note-green\">\n    <div><span class=\"underline\">行动起来！</span></div>\n    <div class=\"note-pink\">不要假努力！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：解决方法题型</h2>\n  <p class=\"req\">要求考生列举出解决问题的多种途径。</p>\n  <ol class=\"numbered\">\n    <li>问题现状</li>\n    <li>怎样解决(解决方案的优缺点)</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"highlight-block\">\n    <p>In recent days, we have to face I problem-----A, which is becoming more and more serious. First, ------------(说明A的现状). Second, ---------------(举例进一步说明现状)</p>\n    <p>Confronted with A, we should take a series of effective measures to cope with the situation. For one thing, ---------------(解决方法一). For another --------------(解决方法二). Finally, --------------(解决方法三).</p>\n    <p>Personally, I believe that ------------- (我的解决方法). Consequently, I'm confident that a bright future is awaiting us because ---------------(带来的好处).</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">\n    <span class=\"heart\">♡</span>@新暮囚书<br>\n    From 小红书\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">※ 中考英语作文万能模板：说明利弊题型</h2>\n  <p class=\"req\">这种题型往往要求先说明一下现状，再对比事物本身的利弊，有时也会单从一角度（利或弊）出发，最后往往要求考生表明自己的态度（或对事物前景提出预见）。</p>\n  <ol class=\"numbered\">\n    <li>说明事物现状</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-note-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n      你可以拒绝学习的动力，<br>\n      但你的竞争者不会！\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
